"""
Acme Payments is hiring a Backend Engineer to join our payments team. You will
build and scale distributed services that process customer payments. Required:
3+ years of Python, strong PostgreSQL, and experience designing REST APIs on
AWS. Bonus points for Kubernetes or Go. You'll own services end to end,
including CI/CD.
"""

